      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_2",
      "label": "User projected onto the text as the speaker of the generational memory",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material 'i remember telling people to eat my ass as an insult not a snack offer' because the meme invites the viewer to identify with the speaker of this generational memory. The phrase 'I remember' creates a direct address to the viewer, implying 'you' or 'I' (the user) are the one recalling this past usage of the phrase, thus projecting the user onto the text.",
